erPresent%3Aindex%3D%3D%3D5%3Fdescriptor.setterPresent%3Afalse%3B%0A%7D%0A%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Prefix%20states%20may%20temporarily%20contain%20both%20data%2Faccessor%20attributes.%20The%0A%20%2A%20specification%20rejects%20that%20combination%20only%20after%20all%20required%20Get%20steps.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptOrdinaryHeap%7D%20heap%20%40param%20%7BJavaScriptDescriptorConversionState%7D%20state%20%40returns%20%7Bstring%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readJavaScriptDescriptorConversionStateError%28heap%2Cstate%29%7B%0A%20%20const%20heapError%3DreadJavaScriptOrdinaryHeapError%28heap%29%3Bif%28heapError%21%3D%3D%27%27%29return%20heapError%3B%0A%20%20if%28state.receiver.%24%21%3D%3D%27object%27%29return%20%27descriptor%20conversion%20retains%20its%20actual%20Object%20receiver%27%3B%0A%20%20const%20receiverError%3DreadJavaScriptOrdinaryValueError%28heap%2Cstate.receiver%29%3Bif%28receiverError%21%3D%3D%27%27%29return%20receiverError%3B%0A%20%20if%28%21Number.isSafeInteger%28state.next%29%7C%7Cstate.next%3C0%7C%7Cstate.next%3E6%7C%7Cstate.next%3D%3D%3D0%26%261%2Fstate.next%3C0%7C%7Cstate.pending%26%26state.next%3D%3D%3D6%29return%20%27descriptor%20conversion%20needs%20its%20exact%20ordered%20field%20continuation%27%3B%0A%20%20for%28let%20index%3Dstate.next%3Bindex%3C6%3Bindex%2B%3D1%29if%28testJavaScriptDescriptorFieldPresence%28state.descriptor%2Cindex%29%29return%20%27unprocessed%20descriptor%20attributes%20cannot%20be%20fabricated%20in%20a%20continuation%27%3B%0A%20%20const%20descriptor%3Dstate.descriptor%3B%0A%20%20if%28descriptor.valuePresent%26%26readJavaScriptOrdinaryValueError%28heap%2Cdescriptor.value%29%21%3D%3D%27%27%29return%20%27descriptor%20values%20belong%20to%20the%20actual%20latest%20global%20context%27%3B%0A%20%20if%28descriptor.getterPresent%26%26%28readJavaScriptOrdinaryValueError%28heap%2Cdescriptor.getter%29%21%3D%3D%27%27%7C%7C%21testJavaScriptSemanticAccessor%28descriptor.getter%29%29%29return%20%27a%20processed%20descriptor%20getter%20reta